{"steam_appid":1281040,"steam_name":"Baby Steps","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281040/454459133/ee1e97c6d4f64683eb0d5a7f18223b3db6dfdc5b/1758643931/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758645851","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204827/6a6dcfef0ba5adfab32ee1fe650ac74ddb92df2a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758645851","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/ss_abc270e4088e834206d0d325d6088954d9c83c5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761065780","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/ss_1057427db403c2256ae1dbd5a279c70003291f19.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761065780","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/ss_d392f956f86ef6e77a1b9b11d475943c735652c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761065780","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/ss_3b86a04ce7bc9a98d094b05d815d1cae3262a936.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761065780","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/ss_4f10d0539b2388ab5444164a14debfa49ae38243.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761065780"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Nate, an unemployed failson with nothing going for him, until one day he discovers a power he never knew he had… putting one foot in front of the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shrouded in mist, one step at a time. Hike the serene mountains by placing each footstep yourself, in original physics-based gameplay from the minds behind Ape Out and Getting Over It. Take in the sights, fall in love with the local fauna, and try to find meaning in a wasted life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to fall for Nate, in Baby Steps, a literal walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👟 Fully-simulated physics based walking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/fcf391a5930fcf1e606aa799e3d2bcee.poster.avif?t=1761065780\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/fcf391a5930fcf1e606aa799e3d2bcee.webm?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/fcf391a5930fcf1e606aa799e3d2bcee.mp4?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛰️ A lengthy trek up a mountain-sized mountain that you can explore at your own pace, or slower. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/83cd29be11c4a3ed5d27794771723b27.poster.avif?t=1761065780\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/83cd29be11c4a3ed5d27794771723b27.webm?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/83cd29be11c4a3ed5d27794771723b27.mp4?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >😫 Fully dynamic onesie soilage system. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/e496f2c51bc3f543b3adea899d8d8336.poster.avif?t=1761065780\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/e496f2c51bc3f543b3adea899d8d8336.webm?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/e496f2c51bc3f543b3adea899d8d8336.mp4?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎶A world that seems to come alive with a dynamic soundtrack built up out of 420 beats and vibes. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/975b29f1e270b2d261c32546c7b7c59b.poster.avif?t=1761065780\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/975b29f1e270b2d261c32546c7b7c59b.webm?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/975b29f1e270b2d261c32546c7b7c59b.mp4?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤠 Non-collectible hats.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/683043bdb3c1f172c59df60b17d883cc.poster.avif?t=1761065780\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/683043bdb3c1f172c59df60b17d883cc.webm?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281040/extras/683043bdb3c1f172c59df60b17d883cc.mp4?t=1761065780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650 / Radeon RX 570 / Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 19 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low Quality setting, in 1080p, producing 60 FPS</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 / AMD Ryzen 7 2700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060 Super / Radeon RX 5700 / Arc A580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 19 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High Quality setting, in 1080p, producing 60 FPS</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Gabe Cuzzillo","Maxi Boch","Bennett Foddy"],"publishers":["Devolver Digital"],"release_date":"23 Sep, 2025"}